  "id": 190,
  "description": "Veni Vidi Vici\n\nTeleport beacon - The Citadel\n\nWe know everyone has busy lives, and we don&#039;t expect you to be online 24/7. We value quality over quantity! You don’t need to be constantly present, we only ask you to do what you can to help our family.  Veni Vidi Vici💯💪👍\n\n👍Remember, it&#039;s a game of fantasy🏰\n\n⚔️ RAIDS lvl.80:\n   - 11:00 GMT\n \n⚔️ RAID lvl. 70:\n   - 13:00 GMT\n\n​Let’s keep pushing forward! If you have any questions or will be away for a long period, just let an officer know.\n\n​Good Luck &amp; Have Fun.😎\n\n👑Leader: HunterXYZ\n\n🔱Guild 1st: MyNextGen\n\nWe don&#039;t ask anyone to do anything that makes them uncomfortable...\n\nOur only request is that everyone does what makes them feel good. Helping others makes me feel good💯\n\n🌜wake up smiling🌛go to sleep smiling\n\n⚡️Be Loyal:  Veni Vidi Vici  💯💪 VVV\n\nWe welcome all members at any level!",
